## Función que ejecuta los titles para las tooltips en base a cada misión

## Generales
execute as @a if score var tooltips matches 100 run titleraw @a actionbar {"rawtext":[{"translate":"title.tooltip100.title","with":{"rawtext":[{"text":"\\n"}]}}]}
execute as @a if score var tooltips matches 111 run titleraw @a actionbar {"rawtext":[{"translate":"title.tooltip111.title","with":{"rawtext":[{"text":"\\n"}]}}]}

